# Copie .env.example -> .env e use o mesmo valor de Security__ApiKey
@Garimpo.Api_HostAddress = http://localhost:8080
@ApiKey = sua-chave-do-arquivo-env

### Swagger UI
GET {{Garimpo.Api_HostAddress}}/swagger/index.html

### Ingerir catalogo TLE (requer API Key do .env)
POST {{Garimpo.Api_HostAddress}}/api/ingestion?group=cosmos-2251-debris
X-Api-Key: {{ApiKey}}

### Executar clusterizacao DBSCAN (requer API Key)
POST {{Garimpo.Api_HostAddress}}/api/clusters/run
X-Api-Key: {{ApiKey}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "epsilon": 0.3,
  "minPoints": 5
}

### Listar aglomerados (leitura publica)
GET {{Garimpo.Api_HostAddress}}/api/clusters

### Listar detritos (leitura publica)
GET {{Garimpo.Api_HostAddress}}/api/debris

### Listar alertas de risco (leitura publica)
GET {{Garimpo.Api_HostAddress}}/api/alerts
